@startuml 09-state-authorisation
title Authorisation sub-resource (scaStatus, spec 14.16)
[*] --> received : created implicitly with the consent
received --> psuIdentified : PSU-ID entered at CIAM
psuIdentified --> psuAuthenticated : password verified
psuAuthenticated --> started : QR challenge issued\n(method implicitly selected)
started --> unconfirmed : device signature verified,\nconfirmation link was returned
started --> finalised : device signature verified,\nno confirmation step
unconfirmed --> finalised : PUT .../authorisations/{id}\nwith bearer token
started --> failed : challenge denied / expired /\ntoo many attempts
psuAuthenticated --> failed : risk engine refuses
finalised --> [*]
failed --> [*]
@enduml
